BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Honeyjoon
DTSTART:20260718T013000Z
DTEND:20260718T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20260718T013000Z
UID:hAc1wcx3x8
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 75 mins (1h15m)\n\nIn this light-and-dark comedy\, J
 une and her Persian mom Lela travel to the Azores islands for a grief anni
 versary\, with contrasting ways of coping. A charming surfer brings balanc
 e as they (and we) surf the waves of life\, loss\, flirting… an unforget
 table ride. Director Lilian T. Mehrel scheduled to attend for a post-film
  Q&A on July 17\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/honeyjoon\n\nEs
 timated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
